      "content": "That's a really solid foundation for them. Now, to make sure they're truly prepared for a high-level round, can you do the same for the opposing side? They need to be able to steelman the arguments for more humanitarian-focused policies and expanded pathways for migration. Give them the most sophisticated, philosophically grounded versions of those arguments so they don't just end up arguing against a weak position. Thanks!",
